, "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn8le13ob02re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 11, "template_override": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "stimuli": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}]}, {"type": "audio", "_data": [], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "image": "engenn8le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Hey guys, listen up! I'm going to a film festival tonight! This jacket is pretty decent, don't you think?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> It's a gorgeous jacket! You must be excited about going to the festival. What are you seeing?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> Who are you going with?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> It's none of your business! I trust your clothing expertise and hope you will lead me in the right direction.", "image": "engenn8le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> Okay. Don't be so defensive! How about your footwear?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> Wouldn't you like to wear those new brogue shoes you bought a while back?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> You mean the ones I wore to the party?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> Yes. Shouldn't you also wear those lightweight wool pants?", "image": "engenn8le13ob02re2img02.jpg", "time": "19000", "id": 2}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Yes. Perfect! I'm all set then. Thanks.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span>  Hold your horses! You must be feeling anxious or something. Aren't we going for coffee?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> The last time you acted so skittish, you had a date.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> It's okay V, let's let him keep it to himself. You must be feeling scrutinized, right Peter?", "image": "engenn8le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "33000", "id": 3}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Just leave me be and I'll fill you in tomorrow.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> I get it. Sometimes we all need a little privacy in matters of the heart.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter:</span> Oh Vanessa, don't be so facetious! You must be feeling left out. Remember I told you about everything that happened last time? I didn't leave anything out.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally:</span> You did. And didn't we ask him about a million questions?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa:</span> You're right,Sally! You must be feeling pressured, Peter!", "image": "engenn8le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "54000", "id": 4}], "coverimg": "engenn8le13ob02re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le13ob02re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}]}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The Secret Valentine", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "What to Wear", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Describe events  through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Negative Questions to Encourage Agreement", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use negative questions to confirm information you already know. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Look at these examples: <br /><br />  <span class=\"italic\">This jacket is pretty decent, <span class=\"strong\">don't you think</span>? </span>(You expect the person to say yes.) <br> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Didn't you </span> just buy a new pair of shoes the other day? </span>(You expect the person to say yes.) ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Aren't we going for coffee?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Didn't we ask him about a million questions?", "type": "example"}, {"content": " Wouldn't you like to wear those new brogue shoes you bought a while back?", "type": "example"}, {"content": " Shouldn't you also wear those lightweight wool pants? ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Simple Present Tense and Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Present tense to talk about activities you do regularly or habitually. <br /><br /> You use the Simple Past to talk about actions that were completed in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":13,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Simple Present Tense  </span> <br/>(regular verbs) </div> <br> Third person singular/First person and Third Person plural\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Simple Past Tense <br/>(regular verbs)  </span> </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Simple Present Tense  </span> <br/>(regular verbs) </div><br> Third person singular/First person and Third Person plural\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Simple Past Tense <br/>(irregular verbs)  </span> </div><br> Third person Singular and First person /Third Person plural\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" trusts/trust\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" trusted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" has/have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" hopes/hope\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hoped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" tells/tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" told\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" needs/need\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"needed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" leaves/leave\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"left\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" acts/act\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"acted\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" wears/wear\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" wore\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" am/is/are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I <span class=\"strong\">trust </span>your clothing expertise and <span class=\"strong\">hope</span> you will lead me in the right direction. (Simple Present)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Don't </span> be so defensive! (Simple Present)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sometimes we all <span class=\"strong\">need </span>a little privacy in matters of the heart. (Simple Present)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Oh Vanessa, <span class=\"strong\">don't </span> be so facetious!  (Simple Present)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You mean the ones I <span class=\"strong\">wore</span> to the party? (Simple Past)", "type": "example"}, {"content": " The last time you <span class=\"strong\">acted  </span> so skittish, you <span class=\"italic\">had </span>a date. (Simple Past)", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I <span class=\"strong\">told </span>you about everything that happened last time. I <span class=\"strong\">didn't</span> leave anything out. (Simple Past)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "</li><li> You use <span class=\"strong\">don't (do not)</span> or <span class=\"strong\">doesn't (does not)</span> to make a negative sentence in the Present tense.</li></ul>           <br> </li><li> With verb <span class=\"strong\">be</span> in Simple Present, you use <span class=\"strong\">am not</span>, <span class=\"strong\">isn't (is not)</span> or <span class=\"strong\">aren't (are not)</span> depending on the pronoun. </li></ul> <br Examples:<br> <span class=\"italic\"> I don't have a pet .   <br> Mary doesn't work at night.            <br>     John  and Susie aren't married.        </span>                                                     ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "</li><li>You use  <span class=\"strong\">didn't (did not)</span> to make a negative sentence in the Past tense.</li></ul> <br></li><li>With verb <span class=\"strong\">be</span> in Simple Past, you use <span class=\"strong\">wasn't (was not)</span> or <span class=\"strong\">weren't (were not)</span> depending on the pronoun.</li></ul>  Example: <br><span class=\"italic\">Mary and Tom didn't come to the party. <br> They weren't invited.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "lightweight ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that is not heavy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is comfortable to wear lightweight clothes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about clothes and feelings. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to listen up", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to listen carefully", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Hey guys! Listen up. I'm going to a film festival tonight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "brogue ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "A heavy shoe with ornamental perforations", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Wouldn't you like to wear those new brogue shoes you bought a while back?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pry", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask curiously about someone's personal affairs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Vanessa usually pries into Peter's love life. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "scrutinized ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "examined carefully", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We should stop asking him. He must feel scrutinized.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to keep to oneself", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to maintain some information in secret ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Let's let him keep it to himself. He doesn't want to tell us now. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "defensive ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be in an attitude of defense against criticism ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter was so defensive when we asked him about his date.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "facetious ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "treating serious matters inappropriately", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Oh Vanessa, don't be so facetious! You must be feeling left out, but you are not. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "skittish ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling nervous ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The last time you acted so skittish, you had a date. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob02aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think about how you would dress for a date and identify pieces of clothing that you would wear.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a story about how you got ready for a date.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the simple past to tell the story.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the story to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a story about getting ready for a date.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I identify clothing pieces I would wear on a date.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the simple past to tell the story.", "type": "text"}]}]}